<h3>7.1 一条清晰的收敛路径</h3>

<p>把五个模型按时间排开，能看到三个同时发生的变化：</p>

<ol>
<li><strong>参数规模</strong>：562B → 55B → 7B → 3.3B。规模不再是瓶颈，数据与训练方式才是。</li>
<li><strong>动作表示</strong>：文本计划 → 离散 token → 连续流匹配。精度上限被逐步打开。</li>
<li><strong>数据来源</strong>：单机构自有数据 → Open X-Embodiment 共享 → 异质数据联合预训练。泛化的来源从"更多同类数据"转向"更多不同来源的数据"。</li>
</ol>

<h3>7.2 一个最小的动作头实现</h3>

<p>无论上游 VLM 怎么变，动作头的形式可以抽象成两种。下面这个片段说明了它们的差别——一个走分类，一个走回归加迭代精修。</p>

<div class="code-block"><div class="code-header">action_head.py — 离散 token vs 流匹配的两种动作头</div><pre>
<span class="kw">import</span> torch
<span class="kw">import</span> torch.nn <span class="kw">as</span> nn


<span class="kw">class</span> <span class="cls">DiscreteActionHead</span>(nn.Module):
    <span class="str">"""RT-2 / OpenVLA：把每一维动作当分类问题，输出 256 个桶上的分布"""</span>

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">__init__</span>(<span class="kw">self</span>, hidden=<span class="num">4096</span>, n_dims=<span class="num">7</span>, n_bins=<span class="num">256</span>):
        <span class="fn">super</span>().<span class="fn">__init__</span>()
        <span class="kw">self</span>.n_dims, <span class="kw">self</span>.n_bins = n_dims, n_bins
        <span class="kw">self</span>.head = nn.<span class="cls">Linear</span>(hidden, n_dims * n_bins)       <span class="com"># 每维一个独立的 256 类分类器</span>

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">forward</span>(<span class="kw">self</span>, h):
        logits = <span class="kw">self</span>.<span class="fn">head</span>(h).<span class="fn">view</span>(-<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="kw">self</span>.n_dims, <span class="kw">self</span>.n_bins)
        <span class="kw">return</span> logits

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">to_action</span>(<span class="kw">self</span>, logits):
        <span class="str">"""连续角度到桶索引：floor(256 * (theta + pi) / (2*pi))"""</span>
        idx = logits.<span class="fn">argmax</span>(dim=-<span class="num">1</span>)
        <span class="kw">return</span> idx / <span class="kw">self</span>.n_bins * <span class="num">2</span> * torch.pi - torch.pi   <span class="com"># 离散精度封顶</span>


<span class="kw">class</span> <span class="cls">FlowMatchingHead</span>(nn.Module):
    <span class="str">"""pi0：预测速度场，推理时从噪声积分到动作，精度不受量化限制"""</span>

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">__init__</span>(<span class="kw">self</span>, hidden=<span class="num">1024</span>, action_dim=<span class="num">14</span>, chunk=<span class="num">50</span>):
        <span class="fn">super</span>().<span class="fn">__init__</span>()
        <span class="kw">self</span>.chunk, <span class="kw">self</span>.action_dim = chunk, action_dim
        <span class="kw">self</span>.net = nn.<span class="cls">Sequential</span>(nn.<span class="cls">Linear</span>(action_dim + hidden, hidden), nn.<span class="cls">GELU</span>(), nn.<span class="cls">Linear</span>(hidden, action_dim))

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">velocity</span>(<span class="kw">self</span>, x_t, cond):
        <span class="str">"""x_t: (B, chunk, action_dim) 带噪动作；cond: (B, hidden) 视觉语言条件"""</span>
        c = cond.<span class="fn">unsqueeze</span>(<span class="num">1</span>).<span class="fn">expand</span>(-<span class="num">1</span>, x_t.<span class="fn">size</span>(<span class="num">1</span>), -<span class="num">1</span>)
        <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="kw">self</span>.net(torch.<span class="fn">cat</span>([x_t, c], dim=-<span class="num">1</span>))

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">training_loss</span>(<span class="kw">self</span>, action, cond):
        x1 = action                                        <span class="com"># 目标动作</span>
        x0 = torch.<span class="fn">randn_like</span>(x1)                       <span class="com"># 纯噪声</span>
        t = torch.<span class="fn">rand</span>(x1.<span class="fn">size</span>(<span class="num">0</span>), <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, device=x1.device)
        x_t = t * x1 + (<span class="num">1</span> - t) * x0                       <span class="com"># 直线插值路径</span>
        target = x1 - x0                                   <span class="com"># 目标速度场</span>
        <span class="kw">return</span> ((<span class="kw">self</span>.<span class="fn">velocity</span>(x_t, cond) - target) ** <span class="num">2</span>).<span class="fn">mean</span>()

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">sample</span>(<span class="kw">self</span>, cond, steps=<span class="num">10</span>):
        <span class="str">"""推理：从 t=0 的噪声出发，用欧拉法积分到 t=1"""</span>
        x = torch.<span class="fn">randn</span>(cond.<span class="fn">size</span>(<span class="num">0</span>), <span class="kw">self</span>.chunk, <span class="kw">self</span>.action_dim, device=cond.device)
        dt = <span class="num">1.0</span> / steps
        <span class="kw">for</span> i <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(steps):
            x = x + dt * <span class="kw">self</span>.<span class="fn">velocity</span>(x, cond)
        <span class="kw">return</span> x
</pre></div>

<div class="callout warn"><div class="callout-title">控制频率是硬约束</div>
<p>灵巧操作要求每秒约 50 次运动指令，也就是每步推理必须在几十毫秒内完成。<strong>任何"再来一次前向"的优化都要先算这笔时间账</strong>——这也是为什么 KV 缓存、动作分块（一次预测 50 步）这些工程手段在 VLA 里格外重要。</p></div>

<h3>7.3 归纳</h3>

<p>VLA 的演进可以读成一句话：<strong>先把动作变成语言的一部分（RT-2），再把动作从语言里救出来（π0）</strong>。前者解决了"知识迁移"，后者解决了"精度上限"。而 π0.5 的分层设计说明，下一步的瓶颈既不在参数也不在精度，而在<strong>如何让模型在没见过的世界里依然知道该先做什么</strong>。</p>

